# T_SCRE: screens that cannot get memory.  The location list cannot
# open, and its "Not enough memory" stays on the home screen until a
# key is read; then the location pick list of an item form cannot
# open from its location field (eleven fields on), and the message
# stays on the form until the next key.
S NOLIST
K ESC
K ENTER CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
S LOCFIELD
K F4
S NOPICK
K ESC ESC
